    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Description\n\n`vim.lsp.client.resolved_capabilities` property as used in https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee7c02297cf95cba07f8bf8da3ecf99337a1c15e/lua/mini/completion.lua#L804 is deprecated as of nvim 0.8.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/14090#issuecomment-1113956767\r\n\r\n```\r\n[LSP] Accessing client.resolved_capabilities is deprecated, update your plugins or configuration to access client.server_capabilities instead.The new key/value pairs in server_capabilities directly match those defined in the language server protocol\r\n```\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.8.0-dev+141-g55187de11\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Upgrade to nvim nightly\r\n2. Enable mini.completion\r\n3. Enter insert mode\r\n4. A message is generated by nvim\r\n\r\nMy mini.completion configuration\r\n\r\n```\r\n             require(\"mini.completion\").setup({\r\n                 lsp_completion = {\r\n                     source_func = \"omnifunc\",\r\n                     auto_setup = false,\r\n                     mappings = {\r\n                         force_twostep = \"<C-Space>\",\r\n                         force_fallback = \"<S-Space>\",\r\n                     },\r\n                 },\r\n             })\r\n```\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo warning message of deprecated API use\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nNvim generates a warning message when initially entering insert mode.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[LSP] Accessing client.resolved_capabilities is deprecated, update your plugins or configuration to access client.server_capabilities instead.The new key/value pairs in server_capabilities directly match those defined in the language server protocol\r\n```",
